# Root Rules — VD-assistent

1. Fail-closed on all configuration errors.
2. pnpm is the only allowed package manager.
3. Governance uses shared `@aihackers-volym` packages — no local rewrites.
4. No silent scope expansion without governance amendment.
5. No shadow systems or duplicate governance implementations.
6. Authority hierarchy: MASTER.md > .rootrules > AGENTS.md > .agentrules
